{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally in Egypt"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Getting to the Nile"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 11}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about travel and places in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le11ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can express an option with the phrases below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some people say that ...<br> In my experience, ...<br> As far as I'm concerned, ...<br> Speaking for myself, ...<br> In my opinion, ...<br> Personally, I think ...<br> I'd say that ...<br> I believe that ...<br> What I mean is ..."}, {"type": "example", "content": "What I mean is, casinos on the Nile is sad. "}, {"type": "example", "content": " I believe that many embassy workers have drivers. <br/> <br/> <br/>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you make and respond to requests, remember to be polite!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you ... ?<br/> I'd like to ...<br/> Would you mind (if) ... ?<br/> Would ... be okay?<br/>I was wondering if ...<br/> Could you ... ?<br/> Do you think you could ... ?<br/> Is there any chance you could ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure, I'll ...<br/> Sure, I'd be glad to ...<br/> No, not at all.<br/> Certainly.<br/> Yes, of course.<br/> I'll see what I can do.<br/> I don't mind at all.<br/> Of course we can ...<br/> No problem.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Would you help me to get down?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'd like to find a place to have cold drinks.  "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "embassy "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a group of people who work under an ambassador and represent their country in a foreign country; the building where an ambassador lives and works"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Canadian Embassy is in the center of Cairo."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear while touring Cairo."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nearby "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be close, not far away "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The hotel was nearby, so we walked there."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "felucca"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small Nile boat with triangular sails  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I took a beautiful ride in a felucca on the Nile."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sail "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to travel on the water in a boat or ship"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The wind made it easy to sail on the lake."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "triangular"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "with three sides "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The sails on the boat were triangular."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "foreigner "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who is not from your country"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Many foreigners visit in the summer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Give your opinion on how you feel about your city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say what you like and don't like about it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use phrases for expressing opinions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 40-50 words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your opinion to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write my opinion about my city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I say what I like and don't like about it. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use phrases for opinions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my opinions to my partner."}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le11ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn5le11ob10re2img06.jpg", "time": "0"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: There are many embassies here.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think it's beautiful.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: Foreigners drive to work. Egyptians take the bus.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I believe that many embassy workers have drivers.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: Yes. They find our traffic stressful.<br/>", "id": 1, "image": "engenn5le11ob10re2img06.jpg", "time": "1750"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Later, can we go back to see the other bank of the Nile?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: Yes. There are wo